  "description": "Validate binary files against 856+ whfmt format definitions (schema v3.1). Detects format via magic bytes (with negative-offset support), runs structural assertions through the runtime expression engine, verifies checksums (CRC32/MD5/SHA1/SHA256/Adler32), and reports forensic patterns. Includes lint-expressions subcommand for static .whfmt validation. Outputs plain text (UTF-8), JSON, or HTML reports. Install: dotnet tool install -g whfmt.Validate",
