  "releaseNotes": "1.0.2 — Catalog bump to whfmt.FileFormatCatalog 1.5.0 (schema v3.1, PHP/Markdown embedded language injection, CSS.whfmt fix, 856+ definitions). No CLI changes — drop-in upgrade from 1.0.1. 1.0.1 — Catalog 1.3.2 (799 definitions, schema v3); negative-offset magic bytes fix; UTF-8 console output. 1.0.0 — Initial public release. Commands: validate / list / info / repair / lint-expressions.",
